WEBVTT

00:00:01.221 --> 00:00:04.126
Five nights later they
reached Stewart Island.

00:00:04.126 --> 00:00:06.001
Captain Cross took them in.

00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:09.398
Next morning Musgrave gave him
the little boat that had carried them.

00:00:11.735 --> 00:00:16.524
In Invercargill, John Macpherson walked
the muddy streets for Henry and George.

00:00:16.524 --> 00:00:19.524
By the second evening he had
raised over a hundred pounds,

00:00:19.524 --> 00:00:21.128
with blankets besides.

